import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Cookie policy"
  description="What cookies and local storage Ruta y Ritmo uses, what they are for and how to change your choice."
  crumb="Cookies"
>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 20 October 2026.</p>

  <h2>What is a cookie</h2>
  <p>
    A cookie is a small file that a site stores in your browser. Local storage
    (<em>localStorage</em>) works in a similar way, but it is not sent to the server
    automatically. Ruta y Ritmo uses local storage to remember your choice about ads.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site uses</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Type</th>
        <th>Purpose</th>
        <th>Duration</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>rutayritmo-consent</code></td>
        <td>Local storage, necessary</td>
        <td>Remember whether you accept or reject advertising.</td>
        <td>Until you clear the site's data.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>__gads</code>, <code>__gpi</code>, <code>IDE</code></td>
        <td>Google advertising</td>
        <td>Measure and personalize ads, limit frequency and detect fraud.</td>
        <td>Up to 13 months, depending on the provider.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    Advertising cookies are only activated if you press “Accept ads”. If you choose
    “Essential only”, the AdSense script is not loaded and the ad spaces remain hidden.
  </p>

  <h2>Consent</h2>
  <p>
    You can change your choice by clearing the site's data in your browser and reloading
    the page. For the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom, personalized
    advertising requires a consent management platform certified by Google; the site is
    prepared to use one before ads are enabled.
  </p>

  <h2>How to block cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies in your browser's privacy settings (Chrome, Firefox,
    Safari, Edge). If you block necessary cookies, the notice may appear again on every
    visit. You can also use ad-blocking extensions; the site will remain readable.
  </p>

  <h2>More information</h2>
  <p>
    See the <a href="/en/privacidad/">privacy policy</a> to learn what data is processed
    and how to exercise your rights. For questions, email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hola@rutayritmo.com">hola@rutayritmo.com</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
